{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1022693421189823", "organization": {"id": "1683459365268266", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1022693421189823"}]}, "id": "340158143031414"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1114078418688328"}]}, "id": "844286245671725"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1092474780792679"}]}, "id": "234185736969693"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "1022693421189823", "release_date": 1485450435, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 10}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1077780939014404"}, "id": "1611883889106706"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1485553129, "id": "1858082761139258", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v2", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 1, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "1199184137277915"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "1022693421189823"}, "id": "1199184137277915", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1022693421189823", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1163881957064886"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2591980444459076", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Time Machine VR\u00a0: Monsters of the Sea", "keywords": ["Dinosaure", "Jurassique", "Science", "Pr\u00e9histoire", "Eau"], "long_description": "Inspir\u00e9 du succ\u00e8s, Time Machine VR, une exp\u00e9rience enrichissante con\u00e7ue sp\u00e9cialement pour Gear VR\u00a0! Vous \u00eates un voyageur du temps envoy\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e8re jurassique avec ses cr\u00e9atures qui r\u00e9gnaient autrefois sur les oc\u00e9ans pr\u00e9historiques. Utilisez des projectiles \u00e0 balayage afin de d\u00e9couvrir et d\u2019en apprendre sur des cr\u00e9atures scientifiquement pr\u00e9cises. \n\nCHARACT\u00c9RISTIQUES \n\n- Explorez 12 niveaux de mondes immersifs sous-marins \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e8re jurassique en VR\u00a0;\n- Un jeu d\u2019interaction avec des cr\u00e9atures pr\u00e9historiques\u00a0;\n- D\u00e9verrouillez de nouvelles cr\u00e9atures myst\u00e9rieuses\u00a0: dacosaures, pl\u00e9siosaures, m\u00e9galodons, et plus encore\u00a0;\n- Am\u00e9liorez votre \u00e9quipement pour avancer \u00e0 travers les niveaux et marquer des points.", "short_description": "Inspir\u00e9 du succ\u00e8s, Time Machine VR, une exp\u00e9rience enrichissante con\u00e7ue sp\u00e9cialement pour Gear VR\u00a0! Remontez le temps vers l\u2019\u00e8re jurassique et les cr\u00e9atures qui r\u00e9gnaient sur les oc\u00e9ans pr\u00e9historiques.\n\n- Un jeu d\u2019interaction avec des cr\u00e9atures pr\u00e9historiques\u00a0;\n- D\u00e9verrouillez de nouvelles cr\u00e9atures myst\u00e9rieuses\u00a0: dacosaures, pl\u00e9siosaures, m\u00e9galodons, et plus encore\u00a0;\n- Am\u00e9liorez votre \u00e9quipement pour avancer \u00e0 travers les niveaux et marquer des points."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2812445925504054", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410454_1699931833653378_4199957727444729856_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jCS1-LoTyZ8Q7kNvwF95X7c&_nc_oc=AdpwUkJAdafTbzB1Xu1o48O9hmU8SIROE3BZpnOeAh2syVgk7dGM79rgvJ4cNobCwSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oc