_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNHDHNx0qKfkPjn4qXQc0xD9djtGFEQefi2FKgJr6ezQw&oe=6AC9086F"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "210599320209608", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139237_1867120743571017_2480277818835992576_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yyen7rNgdzgQ7kNvwGKbpDx&_nc_oc=AdrsyMW8qOlQIu2HDZyeNh6ues3Tt7UWIwpoBcXY6jIaYBVlR5TLJ9IB1TBv4rgylak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOti_rd0_p0-oVbZ3zQd24zQis1gKZfhBRd16q_7OqRsQ&oe=6AC8EDC8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440_rift_maincover.png", "id": "636128699929209", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12427537_636128703262542_1094064806085787648_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yK4Y5OUy7QAQ7kNvwGvTrqt&_nc_oc=AdpZSN0V8EkIWHeDSRYNx_vhlYQvMDwTQ_nNEZbgroUHVjnhJ0mzRyU97pJyB1jYguY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPI9144YfDY-QJreOXMbSspaql4Is8zUbvj7yW5W8sVtw&oe=6AC8F6D9"}, "display_name": "Time Machine VR: Monsters of the Sea", "keywords": ["Dinosaur", "Jurassic", "Science", "Prehistory", "Water"], "long_description": "You are a time-travelling cadet tasked with exploring the Jurassic era and the ancient creatures that once ruled the prehistoric oceans. Use scanning projectiles to examine and learn about scientifically accurate creatures. \n\nFEATURES\n\n- A game about time travel, prehistoric creatures, and extinction; \n- Explore 12 levels of immersive Jurassic underwater VR worlds; \n- Navigate a living and dangerous ecosystem populated by mysterious creatures: dakosaurus, plesiosaurus, megalodon, and more; \n- Upgrade your equipment to travel further in time and score more points.", "short_description": "Travel back in time to explore the Jurassic era and the ancient creatures that once ruled the prehistoric oceans. \n\n- A game about time travel, prehistoric creatures, and extinction; \n- Navigate a living and dangerous ecosystem populated by mysterious creatures: dakosaurus, plesiosaurus, megalodon, and more; \n- Upgrade your equipment to travel further in time and score more points."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "220290852418944", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Time Machine VR: Monsters of the Sea", "keywords": ["Dinosaurio", "Jur\u00e1sico", "ciencia", "prehistoria", "agua"], "long_description": "Inspirado por el \u00e9xito, Time Machine VR, una experiencia emocionante hecha especialmente para Gear VR! Eres es un cadete que viaja en el tiempo con la tarea de explorar la era Jur\u00e1sica y las antiguas criaturas que una vez gobernaron los oc\u00e9anos prehist\u00f3ricos. Usa proyectiles de escaneo para examinar y aprender sobre criaturas cient\u00edficamente precisas.\n\nCARACTER\u00cdSTICAS\n\n- Explora 12 niveles de mundos submarinos inmersivos Jur\u00e1sicos en VR;\n- Un juego sobre la interacci\u00f3n con criaturas prehist\u00f3ricas;;\n- Desbloquea criaturas misteriosas: dacosaurios, plesiosaurios y megalodones, entre otros;\n- Mejora tu equipo para avanzar y marcar mas puntos.", "short_description": "Inspirado por el \u00e9xito, Time Machine VR, una experiencia emocionante hecha especialmente para Gear VR! Viaja en el tiempo a la era jur\u00e1sica y las antiguas criaturas que una vez gobernaron los oc\u00e9anos prehist\u00f3ricos.\n\n- Un juego sobre la interacci\u00f3n con criaturas prehist\u00f3ricas;;\n- Desbloquea criaturas misteriosas: dacosaurios, plesiosaurios y megalodones, entre otros;\n- Mejora tu equipo para avanzar y marcar mas puntos."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "211414480076927", "locale": "zh_HK", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Time Machine VR: Monsters of the Sea", "keywords": ["\u6050\u9f99", "\u4f8f\u7f57\u7eaa", "\u79d1\u5b66", "\u53f2\u524d", "\u6c34"], "long_description": "\u60a8\u662f\u4e00\u540d\u65f6\u9